{"code":200,"data":[{"section":20200001,"header":"上古天真论篇第一","signatureId":"600559174340677","data":[{"id":"20200001","text":"1、昔在黄帝。生而神灵。弱而能言。幼而徇齐。长而敦敏。成而登天。","note":null,"sectionvideo":null,"height":0,"signature":"68C2B46C18C297865FE284283632AFF1","signatureId":"599957141676101","fangList":[]},{"id":"20200002","text":"2、乃问于天师曰：余闻上古之人。春秋皆度百岁。而动作不衰。今时之人。年半百而动作皆衰者。时世异耶？人将失之耶？","note":null,"sectionvideo":null,"height":0,"signature":"2D21DA86E419F27830D67E8419D1A844","signatureId":"599957141676102","fangList":[]},{"id":"20200003","text":"3、岐伯对曰：上古之人。其知道者。法于阴阳。和于术数。食饮有节。起居有常。不妄作劳。故能形与神俱。而尽终其天年。度百岁乃去。今时之人不然也。以酒为浆。以妄为常。醉以入房。以欲竭其精。以耗散其真。不知持满。不时御神。务快其心。逆于生乐。起居无节。故半百而衰也。","note":null,"sectionvideo":null,"height":0,"signature":"ACA7529C09D56D093B5EBCC4B87D53E4","signatureId":"599957141676103","fangList":[]},{"id":"20200004","text":"4、夫上古圣人之教下也。皆谓之虚邪贼风。避之有时。恬淡虚无。真气从之。精神内守。病安从来。是以志闲而少欲。心安而不惧。形劳而不倦。气从以顺。各从其欲。皆得所愿。故美其食。任其服。乐其俗。高下不相慕。其民故曰朴。是以嗜欲不能劳其目。淫邪不能惑其心。愚智贤不肖。不惧于物。故合于道。所以能年皆度百岁而动作不衰者。以其德全不危也。","note":null,"sectionvideo":null,"height":0,"signature":"DE99AF0C0F799A4B6FEE5012CD35BD97","signatureId":"599957141676104","fangList":[]},{"id":"20200005","text":"5、帝曰：人年老而无子者。材力尽邪？将天数然也？","note":null,"sectionvideo":null,"height":0,"signature":"C253CA9B47691CA80E8FFD9A71115BE3","signatureId":"599957141676105","fangList":[]},{"id":"20200006","text":"6、岐伯曰：女子七岁。肾气盛。齿更发长。","note":null,"sectionvideo":null,"height":0,"signature":"F4C3F8626054310EA89CB79438C816BD","signatureId":"599957141676106","fangList":[]},{"id":"20200007","text":"7、二七而天癸至。任脉通。太冲脉盛。月事以时下。故有子。","note":null,"sectionvideo":null,"height":0,"signature":"84870BBD0EB1E482EBB462F9B42803E3","signatureId":"599957141676107","fangList":[]},{"id":"20200008","text":"8、三七肾气平均。故真牙生而长极。","note":null,"sectionvideo":null,"height":0,"signature":"0E85BAE39CEA4E3C0FB1797652911CCA","signatureId":"599957141676108","fangList":[]},{"id":"20200009","text":"9、四七筋骨坚。发长极。身体盛壮。","note":null,"sectionvideo":null,"height":0,"signature":"6746100F19343489DD7278F9429E0C5C","signatureId":"599957141676109","fangList":[]},{"id":"20200010","text":"10、五七阳明脉衰。面始焦。发始堕。","note":null,"sectionvideo":null,"height":0,"signature":"C92131DDA13BE75EADFC32F66F331197","signatureId":"599957141676110","fangList":[]},{"id":"20200011","text":"11、六七三阳脉衰于上。面皆焦。发始白。","note":null,"sectionvideo":null,"height":0,"signature":"43C18162A59CB53494A885DFA9AEFF7F","signatureId":"599957141676111","fangList":[]},{"id":"20200012","text":"12、七七任脉虚。太冲脉衰少。天癸竭。地道不通。故形坏而无子也。","note":null,"sectionvideo":null,"height":0,"signature":"7C619E359D80D51AD344D178D4308C7C","signatureId":"599957141676112","fangList":[]},{"id":"20200013","text":"13、丈夫八岁。肾气实。发长齿更。","note":null,"sectionvideo":null,"height":0,"signature":"FAEE414BF99697A6188E35EF5DFCB95E","signatureId":"599957141676113","fangList":[]},{"id":"20200014","text":"14、二八肾气盛。天癸至。精气溢泻。阴阳和。故能有子。","note":null,"sectionvideo":null,"height":0,"signature":"CA8453463B5442E8FB38234459D93CA1","signatureId":"599957141676114","fangList":[]},{"id":"20200015","text":"15、三八肾气平均。筋骨劲强。故真牙生而长极。","note":null,"sectionvideo":null,"height":0,"signature":"E039E530FE042507C037F4BA26F703FD","signatureId":"599957141676115","fangList":[]},{"id":"20200016","text":"16、四八筋骨隆盛。肌肉满壮。","note":null,"sectionvideo":null,"height":0,"signature":"335D653651C480289E5282A5AB7D3955","signatureId":"599957141676116","fangList":[]},{"id":"20200017","text":"17、五八肾气衰。发堕齿槁。","note":null,"sectionvideo":null,"height":0,"signature":"0485DC78C7B606A6CDC3F51C34EE034A","signatureId":"599957141676117","fangList":[]},{"id":"20200018","text":"18、六八阳气衰竭于上。面焦。发鬓颁白。","note":null,"sectionvideo":null,"height":0,"signature":"58812E1F73A4FF79DDA41452D56051D3","signatureId":"599957141676118","fangList":[]},{"id":"20200019","text":"19、七八肝气衰。筋不能动。天癸竭。精少。肾脏衰。形体皆极。","note":null,"sectionvideo":null,"height":0,"signature":"B41D82C43A2E79257E47535808DA88A0","signatureId":"599957141676119","fangList":[]},{"id":"20200020","text":"20、八八天癸竭。精少。肾藏衰一。形体皆极。则齿发去。","note":null,"sectionvideo":null,"height":0,"signature":"B28854CD57C724C14D199DBA7B31BD9D","signatureId":"599957141676120","fangList":[]},{"id":"20200021","text":"21、肾者主水。受五脏六腑之精而藏之。故五脏盛。乃能泻。今五脏皆衰，筋骨解堕，天癸尽矣。故发鬓白，身体重，行步不正，而无子耳。","note":null,"sectionvideo":null,"height":0,"signature":"FF9EBDE206C0C438F20A79BB200CF936","signatureId":"599957141676121","fangList":[]},{"id":"20200022","text":"22、帝曰：有其年已老而有子者何也？","note":null,"sectionvideo":null,"height":0,"signature":"067B9C6AD3DCD90AFA92E9A69C4771BF","signatureId":"599957141676122","fangList":[]},{"id":"20200023","text":"23、岐伯曰：此其天寿过度。气脉常通。而肾气有余也。此虽有子。男不过尽八八。女不过尽七七。而天地之精气皆竭矣。","note":null,"sectionvideo":null,"height":0,"signature":"B1D947846B93A76D9D3F602632671EA6","signatureId":"599957141676123","fangList":[]},{"id":"20200024","text":"24、帝曰：夫道者年皆百数。能有子乎？","note":null,"sectionvideo":null,"height":0,"signature":"2FD0206C611AC23D89DAB11E17B4EB9A","signatureId":"599957141676124","fangList":[]},{"id":"20200025","text":"25、岐伯曰：夫道者能却老而全形。身年虽寿。能生子也。","note":null,"sectionvideo":null,"height":0,"signature":"1F3470231C4E3FCC877A3419C64CE63A","signatureId":"599957141676125","fangList":[]},{"id":"20200026","text":"26、黄帝曰：余闻上古有真人者。提挈天地。把握阴阳。呼吸精气。独立守神。肌肉若一。故能寿敝天地。无有终时。此其道生。","note":null,"sectionvideo":null,"height":0,"signature":"F8177414C9B34AC4CEFE61DE5286D9AC","signatureId":"599957141676126","fangList":[]},{"id":"20200027","text":"27、中古之时。有至人者。淳德全道。和于阴阳。调于四时。去世离俗。积精全神。游行天地之间。视听八达之外。此盖益其寿命而强者也。亦归于真人。","note":null,"sectionvideo":null,"height":0,"signature":"AB3F1FC25FAC361143DEF8EE538776A0","signatureId":"599957141676127","fangList":[]},{"id":"20200028","text":"28、其次有圣人者。处天地之和。从八风之理。适嗜欲于世俗之间。无恚嗔之心。行不欲离于世。被服章。举不欲观于俗。外不劳形于事。内无思想之患。以恬愉为务。以自得为功。形体不敝。精神不散。亦可以百数。","note":null,"sectionvideo":null,"height":0,"signature":"C37069D3B009830FF965A58A392EFB4D","signatureId":"599957141676128","fangList":[]},{"id":"20200029","text":"29、其次有贤人者。法则天地。象似日月。辩列星辰。逆从阴阳。分别四时。将从上古合同于道。亦可使益寿而有极时。","note":null,"sectionvideo":null,"height":0,"signature":"5518C6C36BF70E392DCE0B2938ED3568","signatureId":"599957141676129","fangList":[]}]}],"msg":"请求成功"}